## 1. PROTOTYPE SCOPE - WHAT IT TESTS, WHAT IT DOES NOT
The prototype tests the architecture's PRICED CHAIN end to end on
hardware articles: ingest -> price -> date -> audit -> encrypt,
exactly as run in software at EQS-1050/1051. It does NOT test the
sheet's superconducting qubit lattice or QKD unit as mechanisms:
those panels are the sheet's labels, their mechanisms NOT SPECIFIED
(door D-UUC2, the designer's hand). Any test report claiming qubit
function from this prototype is a false report by construction.

